Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bhaskix does not vendor third-party source code into this repository. The
following components are fetched at build time by tools/setup-dev.sh and are
distributed under their own licenses. They are build and boot dependencies; no
part of them is linked into the Bhaskix kernel.

  Limine bootloader
    https://github.com/limine-bootloader/limine
    Licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.
    Used only as a boot protocol implementation. The Bhaskix kernel consumes
    bhaskix_boot::Handoff, a project-owned structure; see docs/architecture.md §1.
    Limine is replaceable and is scheduled for replacement by bhaskixboot.efi in
    Phase 2 (docs/roadmap.md).

